### ============================================
### Strapi Admin REST API
### URL: http://localhost:9092
### ============================================

### 1. Admin Register (สร้าง Admin ใหม่ - ใช้ครั้งแรกตอนตั้งค่า Strapi)
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "Admin",
    "lastname": "User",
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "Admin1234"
}

### 2. Admin Login (เข้าสู่ระบบ Admin)
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "Admin1234",
    "rememberMe": false
}

### 3. Admin Forgot Password (ขอรหัสผ่านใหม่)
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com"
}

### 4. Admin Reset Password (รีเซ็ตรหัสผ่าน - ใช้ code จากอีเมล)
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": " resetting-password-code-from-email",
    "password": "NewAdmin1234",
    "passwordConfirmation": "NewAdmin1234"
}

### 5. Admin Profile (ดูข้อมูล Admin ปัจจุบัน - ต้องใช้ Token จาก Login)
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN_FROM_ADMIN_LOGIN>
